<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch cocoa grind rises 16.69 pct in third quarter.</title>
<headline>Dutch cocoa grind rises 16.69 pct in third quarter.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch cocoa grind rose 16.69 percent to 99,549 tonnes in the third quarter of the year, up from 85,311 tonnes in the same 1995 period, the Dutch Cocoa Association (NCV) said on Friday.</p>
<p>Analysts had predicted a rise of around ten percent.</p>
<p>In the second quarter of the year, the Dutch grind rose 6.42 percent to 90,724 tonnes from 85,248 the year earlier.</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
